OL,3,GNEWSAFather keeping teen son's memory
OL,4,Aalive by 'saving lives'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Dad, I've missed my train."
OL,8,FIt is the post-midnight phone call that
OL,9,Fmany parents of teenage children will
OL,10,Fbe all too familiar with.
OL,12,FMichael Buckett's 19-year-old son Ethan
OL,13,Fwould never ask directly for a lift
OL,14,Fhome while stranded in Leeds - more
OL,15,Fthan 20 miles away from home.
OL,17,F"He'd always send a message saying,
OL,18,F'What are you doing?'" Michael recalls
OL,19,Fwith a smile.
